      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-733--c0fb46093d63c2903ba8c1e4a884ce95af1ef6ddf052dbbd0f4decc1de190751.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-734",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "赠王处士",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "许浑",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "归卧养天真，鹿裘乌角巾。\n茂陵闲久病，彭泽醉长贫。\n冠盖西园夜，笙歌北里春。\n谁怜清渭曲，又老钓鱼人。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "dfe537af7fe1fa7e4794828aa19f873e0687e8a36868a60d5c401f647222ed2f",
